<title>POLAND: PLI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 10.9 AND 11.8.</title>
<headline>PLI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 10.9 AND 11.8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb transactions in shares in Polish Life Improvement (PLI) in blocks of 375,000 and 460,000 shares at 10.9 zlotys and one of 165,000 shares at 11.8 were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, PLI was trading at 14.4 zlotys in 107,724 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
